# The SigmaStar bootloader source, from the commit pinned in the raptor board
# defconfigs (BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_CUSTOM_TARBALL_LOCATION).
#
# Buildroot only skips the hash check for BR2_TARGET_UBOOT_LATEST_VERSION, so a
# custom tarball is checked whenever a hash exists -- and pkg-generic looks for
# one under $(BR2_GLOBAL_PATCH_DIR)/<pkg>/<pkg>.hash, which is here. mtd0 has no
# software recovery, so of everything this tree downloads, the bootloader is the
# one whose bytes are worth being certain about.
#
# t31_raptor's U-Boot is not listed: it comes from a git clone rather than a
# tarball, and its download filename is not this one. It keeps the warning.
#
# Locally computed from the archive OpenIPC's own uboot.yml builds from.
sha256  50049a9078f4ef7c5e82a8cd6589e8b3a1ca95c53ce3351ce67e274a95df095a  bf77aff5d44f34d14b89b3f4014aa8dda9834794.tar.gz

